  "name": "P6 MCP for Primavera P6",
  "description": "Reads and, when the user allows it, edits Primavera P6 Professional schedules in a local P6 standalone (SQLite) database or in XER files. 32 read tools return schedule analysis; p6_export_xer writes a caller-named .xer file; 18 write tools change the database, are off by default and apply only after a dry run and a single-use confirmation token. Independent project, not affiliated with Oracle. Off until enabled locally.",
